			"notes": "# Block Reskinner 0.1.0\n\nInitial stable release.\n\n## Features\n- Adds the Reskin Wand\n- Reskin blocks visually without changing their real behavior\n- Server-synced visual skins\n- Works with normal blocks, logs/pillars, glass, plants/leaves, crystals/buds, and connected blocks\n- Connected block editor for fences, walls, panes, and bars\n- Sodium/Iris compatibility\n- Jade tooltip support\n- Crafting recipe: stick + diamond diagonally\n- Modern responsive GUI\n\n## Notes\n- Clients need the mod installed to see visual skins\n- Blocks remain their original blocks for mining, drops, collision, redstone, and portal logic\n- Tall plants and mob heads are not supported yet\n- Some special-rendered/block-entity blocks are intentionally excluded"
		},
